{title: Baahon Ke Darmiyaan}
{artist: Hariharan Jatin Lalit}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]baahon [Bm]ke daramiyaan,
[A]do pyaar [F#m]mil rahe hai
[F#m]jaane kyaa [E]bole man
[E]dole sun [F#m]ke badan
[F#m]dhadakan [A]banee jubaan
[D]khulate [A]band hote,
[A]labo kee [D]ye anakahee
[D]muz se [A]kah rahee hain
[A]ke badhne [D]de bekhudee
[Bm]mil yoo [E]ke daud jaaye,
[E]nas nas [A]mein bijaliyaan
[D]aasamaan ko [A]bhee ye,
[A]hasee raaj [D]hain pasand
[D]ulazee ulazee [A]saason kee,
[A]aawaaj [D]hain pasand
[Bm]motee lootaa [E]rahee hai,
[E]saawan [A]kee badaliyaan
